 "is_hurt": 0}, "56312": {"id": 56312, "motion_name": "motions/login.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|GeneralLiu|HELLO", "delay": 1000, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"56301": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "56302": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "56303": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "56304": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "OPERATIONBEGIN", "caption": "Are these preparations alright? Then can we move out now?"}, "56305": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "This military saber was the masterwork of the best smith I could find, and it cost about...that much. You think it's expensive? It's not that bad though?"}, "56306": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE2", "caption": "The sky...is so close, yet so far..."}, "56307": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "BLACKACTION", "caption": "You'll let me decide? Th-then we'll go with this..."}, "56308": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "LOADING", "caption": "I-I'm sorry! I'll come over right away!"}, "56309": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "Commander, please let me know if there's something you'd like to eat. I've been learning how to cook recently, so maybe I might get a chance to practice... Hm? Anything will do?"}, "56310": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "I honestly didn't think I'd be able to come this far... Ah, that's not what I mean, I'm saying that I'm very happy! <> Although I'm not too good with words most of the time, I have always viewed you as a role model. <> Commander, it is an honor for me to take the next step as your companion!"}, "56311": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "56312": {"char_code": "GeneralLiu", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Hello, Commander... Should I begin patrolling the campgrounds now?"}}}